ee7fdf0e87015947b71","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13. 如图所示, 空间中存在水平方向的匀强电场和匀强磁场, 电场方向水平向左, 磁场方向垂直纸面向里。一速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的带电小球恰能做匀速直线运动, 速度方向与水平方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 角斜向右下方, 最后进入一轴线沿小球运动方向且固定摆放的一光滑绝缘管道(管道内径略大于小球直径), 下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e71b4938366743edc6b3f2427589b5cbfa7aee15ad9cbad2fce28c48dede5740.png","width":406,"height":256,"width_mm":47.67,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第13题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 小球带负电"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 磁场和电场的大小关系为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E = 2Bv_{0}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 若小球刚进入管道时撤去磁场, 小球仍做匀速直线运动"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 若小球刚进入管道时撤去电场, 小球运动时的机械能守恒"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"CD","body":[]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6731881355ba0909c42408d06d569d12869b1bb0a8742c996b497c45a4e19ae4","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题(Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共14分)\n14-I.(4分)用如图甲所示装置“探究平抛运动的特点”。将白纸和复写纸对齐重叠并固定在竖直背板上。钢球沿斜槽轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"M"},{"type":"text","value":" 滑下后从斜槽末端飞出，落在水平放置的可上下调节的倾斜挡板 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 上。由于挡板靠近背板一侧较低，钢球落在挡板上时，会在白纸上挤压出一个痕迹点。移动挡板，重新释放钢球，如此重复，白纸上将留下一系列痕迹点。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f71140a277771336770e610258bf59ba8e722308947e79d4e93e45b325a69972.png","width":242,"height":256,"width_mm":28.35,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n(1)为完成实验,还需下列（填空）器材(填写序号);\nA. 托盘天平    B. 游标卡尺    C. 刻度尺    D. 秒表\n第14-I题图\n(2)下列实验注意事项必须要满足的是（填空）；(多选)\nA. 斜槽末端水平\nB. 实验所用的斜槽要尽量光滑, 以减小摩擦\nC. 为了挤压的点迹清晰, 白纸应固定在复写纸下面\nD. 为较准确描绘出钢球的运动轨迹, 必须用光滑的曲线把所有的点都连接起来\n(3)为定量研究,建立以水平方向为 x 轴、竖直方向为 y 轴的坐标系,取平抛运动的起始点为坐标原点,下列图像能正确反映 y 与 x 关系的可能是 （填空）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/355d2c94b4d9b9a9b21de5e80e1c6c745c1d9ca87e310641dbc39c3055a7282b.png","width":822,"height":249,"width_mm":96.661,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/11c2aa1df985fb05732a7f063cb2bfa5795be09e24e37d3f4e83888169f4a033.png","width":240,"height":214,"width_mm":28.14,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n第14-I题图\n(4)某同学在实验时遗漏了记录平抛运动的起点,但其记录了抛出点下方的 y 轴和部分运动轨迹,如图乙所示,并在此抛物线上取两点 A、B,过 A、B 两点向 y 轴作垂线,分别交于 C、D 两点,用刻度尺测出 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{AC}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{BD}"},{"type":"text","value":" 及 CD 的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h_{CD}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。重力加速度大小为 g,则初速度求解的表达式为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）。\n14-Ⅱ.（7分）某实验小组计划先用多用电表测量定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值，再设计电路测量电源的电动势和内阻。实验器材有：待测定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，待测电源（电动势E，内阻r），多用电表一只，电阻箱R，开关一个，导线若干。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b2b851b5de12efbd58c024b925ad852d587c82dbf097ef43cb105d7291978600.png","width":213,"height":304,"width_mm":24.99,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图a\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/789da4cdf4f5f80d03d551b7076661c57c97a583eef8f19a3c2bc8951b700c66.png","width":403,"height":262,"width_mm":47.25,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图b\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3d4696df001f1c3dca56b673a52cd42f84e6037731a351c22a5ec5829d5bdf20.png","width":398,"height":257,"width_mm":46.62,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row3"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-Ⅱ题图\n图c\n(1)用多用电表测量定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的阻值。\n①对多用电表完成机械调零后,先将选择开关调到欧姆“×10”挡,再将红、黑表笔短接,调整图 a 中多用电表的（填空）(选填“A”或“B”)旋钮,进行欧姆调零;\n②将红、黑表笔分别与定值电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 两端相连，多用电表指针位置如图 b 所示；\n③应将选择开关调到欧姆（填空）（选填“×1”或“×100”）挡，再次进行欧姆调零后重新测量，指针位置如图 c 所示，定值电阻的阻值 "},{"type":"math","value":"R_{0}="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"；\n(2)用多用电表测量电源电动势和内阻。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b525abb71f513afb6b7ce20c0fd68f981e789eea9ca6e764399298a93cead097.png","width":553,"height":478,"width_mm":64.89,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图d\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5ca32e5686c4dd9f01640bc589051edd78bc0ccf514cbb7fa399f6e18aa9553e.png","width":332,"height":243,"width_mm":38.85,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row4"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图e\n第14—Ⅱ题图\n①将多用电表选择开关调到直流电压 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, V"},{"type":"text","value":" 挡；\n②按图 d 所示电路正确连接实物, 多用电表接线端 P 应该与电阻箱 R 的接线柱 （填空）(选填“A”或“B”) 连接;\n③闭合开关,调节电阻箱 R,读出多用电表示数 U,测得多组 R 和 U 并做好记录;\n④根据实验数据,作出 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{U}-\\frac{1}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":" 图像如图e所示,电源电动势 "},{"type":"math","value":"E="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）V,内阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"r="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"。(结果均保留3位有效数字)\n(3)若实验小组不用电压挡,在其他器材不变的情况下使用多用电表的电流挡接线、测量,获得正确的数据,则测得的电动势（填空）(选填“大于”“等于”或“小于”)真实值。\n14-Ⅲ.(3分)某研究性学习小组利用洛埃镜实验测光的波长。洛埃镜实验的基本装置如图甲所示，S为单色光源，M为平面镜，S光源直接发出的光和经过平面镜M反射的光形成一对相干光源。设光源S到平面镜的垂直距离和到光屏的垂直距离分别为a和L，用某种波长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda"},{"type":"text","value":" 的单色光做干涉实验时，在光屏上形成如图乙所示干涉条纹。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/7da9ef323893f901b27e7a16309a40a6d69f6264d32edc0c9a4413b87016730e.png","width":651,"height":415,"width_mm":76.44,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a3fe282664511356fe834269abbd5b52cbed1617f99682c5b50831f3e5f4d2d5.png","width":333,"height":213,"width_mm":39.06,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/295e5db6bbe562a415562de07676ecf3f78ae40b407cc8700a0c53089686da88.png","width":269,"height":153,"width_mm":31.5,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14—Ⅲ题图\n(1)其中 L 的大小由图丙中的毫米刻度尺读出, "},{"type":"math","value":"L ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）cm; a 的大小由图丁中的游标卡尺读出, "},{"type":"math","value":"a ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）mm;\n(2)已知光屏上第一条亮条纹 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 到第七条亮条纹 "},{"type":"math","value":"x_{7}"},{"type":"text","value":" 之间间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"6.00 \\mathrm{~mm}"},{"type":"text","value":" , 结合上述数据,该单色光的波长约为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\lambda ="},{"type":"text","value":" （填空）m。(结果保留两位有效数字)"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"14. 实验题(Ⅰ、Ⅱ、Ⅲ三题共 14 分, 每空 1 分)"},{"type":"math","value":"14 - \\text{I} \\cdot (1) \\text{C}; (2) \\text{AC}; (3) \\text{B}; (4) \\sqrt{\\frac{g(x_{BD}^{2} - x_{AC}^{2})}{2h_{CD}}}"},{"type":"math","value":"14 - \\text{II} \\cdot (1) B; \\times 1; 8; (2) B; 8.33; 1.00; (3)"},{"type":"text","value":"等于"},{"type":"math","value":"14 - \\text{III} \\cdot (1) 74.90; 0.25; (2) 6.7 \\times 10^{-7}"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e3d2f912b43b41c4d022ff6297634b7e204f26860647301d3ec0de62553e35f7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.(8分)如图所示,在竖直放置的圆柱形容器内用质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 1 \\mathrm{~kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的活塞密封一定质量的理想气体,容器口有一卡口,防止活塞冲出容器,活塞能无摩擦地滑动,容器的横截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S = 100 \\mathrm{~cm}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,开始时气体的温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{0} = 300 \\mathrm{~K}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,活塞与容器底的距离为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 20 \\mathrm{~cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,当气体被加热后,活塞缓慢上升 "},{"type":"math","value":"d = 2 \\mathrm{~cm}"},{"type":"text","value":" 刚好到达容器口,后活塞保持不动,气体被继续加热至温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T = 396 \\mathrm{~K}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,活塞与卡口间相互挤压,达到最终状态,整个过程中气体从外界吸收热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 120 \\mathrm{~J}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0} = 0.99 \\times 10^{5} \\mathrm{~Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(1)活塞刚好到达容器口时缸内气体的压强和温度分别为多少?\n(2)在整个过程中密闭气体内能改变了多少?\n(3)达到最终状态后,由于意外导致容器开始缓慢漏气,漏气过程中容器内温度视为不变,求活塞与卡口刚要分离时,漏出的气体与容器内剩余气体的质量之比。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/66adefea07711260b64b06f73fba41e6b654f60133121d6ca5b5965fccc201aa.png","width":310,"height":287,"width_mm":36.33,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数: 重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"15.(1)刚好到达容器口,封闭气体压强不变,"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{V_{1}}{T_{1}} = \\frac{V_{2}}{T_{2}}, V_{1} = Sh, V_{2} = S(h + d)"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=\\frac{V_{2}}{V_{1}}T_{1}=330\\ K"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n活塞缓慢上升时,设压强为"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":",有"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}S + mg = p_{1}S, p_{1} = 1 \\times 10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"Pa 1 分\n(2)达到最终状态,气体对外做的功"},{"type":"math","value":"W=p_{1}Sd=20\\ J"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = Q - W = 100 \\, J"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n(3)达到最终状态,气体体积不变"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{p_{2}}{T_{2}}=\\frac{p_{3}}{T_{3}},T_{3}=T"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{3}=1.2\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"Pa 1 分\n刚要分离时气体压强"},{"type":"math","value":"p=p_{1}=1\\times10^{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"Pa"},{"type":"math","value":"p_{3}V_{3}=pV,V=1.2V_{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n所以气体与剩余气体质量之比"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{M_1}{M_2} = \\frac{V - V_3}{V_3} = \\frac{1}{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"c452bf6fdce7f6e1ec7621e607804ff62614fb8ec9f01916893caa1cb83d9ff5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(11分)一个游戏装置如图所示,由一个高度为 h 可调的粗糙倾斜轨道 AB,并且保持 "},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}=1\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 不变,竖直圆轨道的最低点 C 和 D 相互靠近且错开,在最低点分别与水平轨道 BC,DF 相连接,水平轨道 BC 光滑,DF 粗糙,DF 轨道终端与一水平传送带平齐相连(轮子很小)。竖直圆轨道半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=0.3\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" ,直轨道 DF 长也为 1 m,传送带 FG 的长度为 2 m,其沿逆时针以恒定 2 m/s 的速度匀速转动,小滑块与传送带间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{1}=0.4"},{"type":"text","value":" ,小滑块与 AB、DF 间的动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu_{2}=0.3"},{"type":"text","value":" ,所有轨道均在同一竖直面内,各接口处平滑连接。现调节高度 h,让一质量为 200 g 的小滑块(可视为质点)从高为 h 处由静止释放。\n(1)若高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"h=0.5\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" , 求小滑块第一次经过 C 点时对轨道的压力大小。\n(2)若保证小滑块第一次到达竖直圆轨道时不脱离圆轨道,求释放高度 h 的范围。\n(3)从某高度释放,若小滑块恰好通过 E 点,小滑块首次滑上传送带并返回 F 点,求整个运动过程中小滑块与传送带因摩擦产生的热量。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d81e12661cff02519c9b8bc34e7e01b008f131600d6e6efeae860fac5a1ef5f9.png","width":976,"height":294,"width_mm":114.66,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 16 题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数: 重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"16.(1)小滑块从"},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":"点到"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"点，根据动能定理有："},{"type":"math","value":"mgh - \\mu mgL\\cos \\theta = \\frac{1}{2} mv_C^2 mgh - \\mu mgL_1 = \\frac{1}{2} mv_C^2"},{"type":"text","value":"所以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{C} = 2\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分在"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"点对小滑块分析有："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} - mg = \\frac{mv_{C}^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"所以"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{N}} = \\frac{14}{3}\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分由牛顿第三定律可知，"},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\text{压}} = F_{\\mathrm{N}} = \\frac{14}{3}\\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分(2)若滑块恰好经过"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"点，有"},{"type":"math","value":"mg = \\frac{mv_E^2}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"由动能定理可知："},{"type":"math","value":"mgh_{1} - \\mu mgL_{1} - mg\\times 2R = \\frac{1}{2} mv_{E}^{2},h_{1} = 1.05\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分若滑块恰好到达竖直圆轨道圆心等高处，由动能定理可知："},{"type":"math","value":"mgh_{2} - \\mu mgL_{1} - mgR = 0,h_{2} = 0.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分若滑块能到达竖直圆轨道，由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"mgh_{3} - \\mu mgL_{1} = 0,h_{3} = 0.3\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分综上，若保证小滑块第一次到达竖直圆轨道，且不脱离圆轨道，高度的范围为："},{"type":"math","value":"h\\geq 1.05\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"0.3\\mathrm{m} < h\\leq 0.6\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分(3)小滑块从"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"点到首次经过"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"点过程中，由动能定理可知"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"点速度："},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\times 2R - \\mu mgl_{DF} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_F^2 -\\frac{1}{2} mv_E^2,v_F = 3\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分滑块在传送带上做匀减速直线运动，加速度大小为："},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{\\mu mg}{m} = \\mu g = 4\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"速度减为0时，所用时间"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1 = \\frac{v}{a} = 0.75\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"小滑块向右的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{1} = \\frac{v_{F}^{2}}{2a} = 1.125\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带向左走的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{2} = vt_{1} = 1.5\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"小滑块与传送带因摩擦产生的热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1} = \\mu mg(x_{1} + x_{2}) = 2.1\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分分析可知小滑块速度减为0后，反向加速到与传送带共速运动回"},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":"点，到共速所用时间："},{"type":"math","value":"t_2 = \\frac{v_\\text{传}}{a} = 0.5\\mathrm{s}"},{"type":"text","value":"小滑块向左走的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{3} = \\frac{v_\\text{传}^{2}}{2a} = 0.5\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"传送带向左走的位移"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{4} = vt_{2} = 1\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"小滑块与传送带因摩擦产生的热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2} = \\mu mg(x_{4} - x_{3}) = 0.4\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分所以"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总}} = Q_{1} + Q_{2} = 2.5\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"7fb2b96223e2790508b05ed914fd51fadbc50f7149c7750c57bc6425185230c8","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(12分)如图所示,固定一金属导轨,间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L=1\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" ,两导轨的长度均足够长,导轨的倾斜部分倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=53^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ,并处于垂直于斜面向上的匀强磁场中,磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小为0.5 T,左上端连接了一恒流源,可以使回路有1 A的恒定电流,不工作时相当于断路,导轨的水平部分处于竖直向上的匀强磁场中,磁感应强度的大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=1\\ T"},{"type":"text","value":" ,水平轨道不计摩擦,导轨右端与一电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R=1\\ \\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" 相连,倾斜部分在PQ两处各用一小段绝缘材料制成,长度不计。现有质量均为0.2 kg的导体棒ab、cd,电阻均为1 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ,均被锁定在导轨上(锁定装置未被画出),导体棒cd离水平和倾斜部分连接处MN的长度 "},{"type":"math","value":"l=1.2\\ m"},{"type":"text","value":" 。某时刻恒流源开始工作,使有从a流向b的电流,立即解除对导体棒ab的锁定,使导体棒ab获得2.5 m/s "},{"type":"math","value":"^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的加速度,经过3 s后,刚好越过PQ,同时恒流源停止工作,经过一段时间后匀速到达MN处,ab棒与cd棒相碰前立即取消对cd棒的锁定,两棒相碰(时间极短)后粘连在一起,直到停止。不计导体棒ab经过MN时的机械能损失,求:(sin 53°=0.8,cos 53°=0.6)\n(1)导体棒 ab 与倾斜轨道部分的动摩擦因数；\n(2) 导体棒 ab 到达连接处 MN 的速度大小;\n(3) "},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒与 "},{"type":"math","value":"cd"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒相遇前, "},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":" 棒的速度;\n(4)从 ab 棒进入水平轨道,到两棒静止,电阻 R 上产生的焦耳热。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d9962dd34f8bb78d39c7411e5bebd7fe0dbd6c3a000a844ee36e2da3cfad35f6.png","width":720,"height":362,"width_mm":84.667,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数: 重力加速度 g 取 "},{"type":"math","value":"10 \\, m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.(1)对导体棒 ab 分析:"},{"type":"math","value":"mg \\sin 53^{\\circ}-\\mu mg \\cos 53^{\\circ}-B_{1}IL=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu=0.5"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(2)到达MN前已匀速，对导体棒ab分析有："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{\\mathrm{A}} = B_{1}I_{1}L,I_{1} = \\frac{E}{R_{\\text{总}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"E = B_{1}Lv_{1},R_{\\text{总}} = 1.5\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin 53^{\\circ} - \\mu mg\\cos 53^{\\circ} - F_{\\mathrm{A}} = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 6\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(3)当"},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":"棒进入水平轨道后，根据动量定理有："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\frac{B_2^2L^2l}{R_\\text{总}} = mv_2 - mv_1"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2} = 2\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(4)当"},{"type":"math","value":"ab"},{"type":"text","value":"棒切割时"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总} 1} = \\frac{1}{2} mv_2^2 - \\frac{1}{2} mv_1^2 = 3.2\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"此时电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"上产生的焦耳热："},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1} = Q_{\\text{总} 1} \\times \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{8}{15}\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分两导体棒相碰，"},{"type":"math","value":"mv_{2} = 2mv_{3}, v_{3} = 1\\mathrm{m / s}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分至两导体棒静止，"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{\\text{总} 2} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 2mv_3^2 = 0.2\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"电阻"},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"上产生的热量"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{2} = Q_{\\text{总} 2} \\times \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{2}{15}\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分所以"},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":"上产生的总焦耳热："},{"type":"math","value":"Q_{1} + Q_{2} = \\frac{2}{3}\\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--gaosan-shiyingxing-2502","source_question_id":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"69b062b8c2a211688e8d14d2b542fb62c35a8ff2b16bcdd45b4c9c496b715b7c","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(13分)现代电子设备常用电场和磁场控制带电粒子的运动。一质量为 m、电荷量为 q 的粒子,以初速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 沿中心轴线方向射入平行金属板,板间可视为匀强电场,方向竖直向上,板间距为 d,板长 "},{"type":"math","value":"l=\\frac{4}{3}d"},{"type":"text","value":" ,粒子射入后恰好从上极板右边缘 A 点射出,现取金属板右端 AB 的中点 O 为坐标原点,延长中心轴线向右为 x 轴正方向,过 O 点与 x 轴垂直为 y 轴,粒子离开电场后立即进入存在磁场的第一象限区域,x=0 到 x=L 为 I 区域,x=L 到 "},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{3}{2}L"},{"type":"text","value":" 为 II 区域,大小分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场,方向均垂直于纸面向里。( "},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 37^{\\circ}=0.6,\\cos 37^{\\circ}=0.8"},{"type":"text","value":" )\n(1)求该粒子所带电性以及进入磁场时的速度；\n(2)若从 A 点进入磁场的粒子恰好不能进入Ⅱ区域,求此时 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小;\n(3) 若 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2}=2B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，粒子能到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{3}{2}L"},{"type":"text","value":" 处，求 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的最大值；\n(4)现改变Ⅰ、Ⅱ区域磁场大小，并充满第一象限，使其沿 x 轴正方向线性递增，磁场大小满足 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{3}=B_{0}kx"},{"type":"text","value":" ，方向不变，则该粒子在磁场运动过程中能达到的水平位移最大值为多少？\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9232c8ba615a554bb43f13a4d7417b43d038eed8bcd3bee99e3b28f2fc3c0e4f.png","width":534,"height":433,"width_mm":62.794,"row_group":"gaosan-shiyingxing-2502-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.(1)粒子向上偏转, 可知粒子带正电, 1 分\n粒子恰好从 A 点射出, 若进入磁场时速度与 x 轴正方向夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":",\n由分析可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{3}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{5}{4}v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n(2)从 A 点进入磁场的粒子恰好不能进入Ⅱ磁场区域,粒子运动轨迹与两磁场分界线相切,\n由几何关系可知此时粒子的运动半径 R 满足"},{"type":"math","value":"R-L=R\\sin37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n得 R=2.5L 1 分\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB_{1}=m\\frac{v^{2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=\\frac{mv_{0}}{2qL}"},{"type":"text","value":"1 分\n(3)"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f96777e284f8239eb190970f662edda4034a0b6ee1af3adc53cb7641903c3724.png","width":332,"height":312,"width_mm":42},{"type":"text","value":"方法一:由几何关系可知"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{\\frac{r}{2}-\\frac{L}{2}}{r\\sin37^{\\circ}+L}=\\frac{1}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"r = 5L"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"qvB_{1}=m\\frac{v^{2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=\\frac{mv_{0}}{4qL}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n方法二:由动量定理有:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum qv_{1x}B_{1}\\Delta t+\\sum qv_{2x}B_{2}\\Delta t=mv-mv\\sin37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"math","value":"L q B _ {1} + \\frac {1}{2} L q \\times 2 B _ {1} = m v - m v \\sin 3 7 ^ {\\circ}"},{"type":"math","value":"2LqB_{1} = \\frac{2}{5} mv"},{"type":"text","value":"3分\n所以"},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"最大值为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{mv_0}{4qL}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(4)分析可知,到达水平位移最大时,速度的水平分量为零。由动量定理有:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum q v _ {x} B _ {3} \\Delta t = m v - m v \\sin 3 7 ^ {\\circ}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum q v _ {x} B _ {0} k x \\Delta t = q B _ {0} k \\sum x \\Delta x = m v - m v \\sin 3 7 ^ {\\circ}"},{"type":"math","value":"qB_{0}k\\frac{x_{m}^{2}}{2}=\\frac{2}{5}mv"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"math","value":"x_{\\mathrm{m}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{mv_0}{qB_0k}}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分\n(用其他方法求解同样给分)"}]}}]}
